=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  sysctl menu --------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. Main menu 8, the Configuration$
# group, with Kernel Settings as item 4.$
$
# Configuration ################################################$
$
   1) hardn.yml            View the file hardn reads$
   2) Syslog Settings      Send logs to a syslog server$
   3) NTP Settings         Keep the clock in sync$
   4) Kernel Settings      Harden network and kernel$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-4 or q]:$
$
$

